OL,3,GNEWSAOrange Order march row goes to
OL,4,Aheart of ongoing divisions in Northern
OL,5,AIreland
OL,6,
OL,7,FHistory shows that a crisis in Northern
OL,8,FIreland is easier to start than finish.
OL,10,FWhat makes the latest difficulties
OL,11,Fespecially hard to resolve is that
OL,12,Fthere is a stand-off at ground-level as
OL,13,Fwell as within the political process.
OL,15,FThe combination of the five Ps `
OL,16,Fpolitics, parading, protests, policing
OL,17,Fand Portadown ` often does not end
OL,18,Fwell.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
